      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZARA ZORRO (8) is a newcomer for the Nicholas Howard kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Expected to be well fancied and can make an immediate impact. MR CARTER (4) finished midfield on debut when fourth (19.86) at this track over 340m. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. OLD FENCER (6) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 26.45 beating Rojo Alawa. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Leading player again. MILLIE MINARDI (1) returns after a break and looks a top-three hope.",
